# CriminalIP — cybercrime intelligence / IP reputation
# Signup: https://www.criminalip.io/
# Docs: https://www.criminalip.io/developer/api
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: API key (x-api-key header)
# HUNTSMAN_CRIMINALIP_KEY=your_criminalip_api_key_here

